.TH PSModelFree 3 2024-03-09 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSModelFree\fR \- Free model memory

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
void  
.br
\fBPSModelFree\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Free \fImodel\fR and all its related objects (layers, data, ...). If the model is part of a multi-model chain, all models following \fImodel\fR will also be freed.
.br
The functions safely checks whether \fImodel\fR is \fINULL\fR and it does nothing in this case.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1)
